Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.02,0:00:11.85,Naruto - Script,,0,0,0,,In the distant past, there lived an era \Nof unrelenting violence and bloodshed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.43,0:00:15.85,Naruto - Script,,0,0,0,,It was a time before ninja had created any villages,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:22.22,Naruto - Script,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,500)}and shinobi lived in organized \Nclans where battle is all they knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.35,0:00:32.85,Naruto - Script,,0,0,0,,Amongst the countless ninja clans,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.85,0:00:44.14,Naruto - Script,,0,0,0,,the Uchiha stood out the most due to \Ntheir Sharingan and impressive chakra.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.68,0:00:51.72,Naruto - Script,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,500)}However, there was one clan that could stand up to them, and they were known as Senju.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.27,0:00:57.47,Naruto - Script,,0,0,0,,The most famous member of the Senju \Nclan was their leader, Senju Hashirama.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.18,0:01:02.43,Naruto - Script,,0,0,0,,Throughout their history, Uchiha and \NSenju were constantly intertwined in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.35,0:01:04.47,Naruto - Script,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.35,0:01:14.31,Naruto - Script,,0,0,0,,Both clans were exhausted, having to\N endure endless battles, one after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.31,0:01:16.93,Naruto - Script,,0,0,0,,They reached their limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.93,0:01:26.43,Naruto - Script,,0,0,0,,The Senju approached the Uchiha in hopes for a truce, which the Uchiha agreed upon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.06,0:01:31.35,Naruto - Script,,0,0,0,,The two clans then built what is known today as the HIdden Leaf Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.18,0:01:36.18,Naruto - Script,,0,0,0,,However, fearing that the Senju would oppress him and his clan,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.18,0:01:38.47,Naruto - Script,,0,0,0,,Uchiha Madara attempted to rally support to overthrow Hashirama.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.35,0:01:45.14,Naruto - Script,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,870)}However, the Uchiha refused to help, so Madara abandoned the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.39,0:01:53.06,Naruto - Script,,0,0,0,,In order to avenge what he felt was betrayal,\N Madara eventually returned to battle against the HIdden Leaf Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.47,0:05:08.27,Naruto - Script,,0,0,0,,The battle took place in an area that we know \Ntoday as the Valley of the End, and as for Madara...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.52,0:05:24.52,Naruto - Script,,0,0,0,,It was Hashirama who emerged victorious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.47,0:05:40.77,Naruto - Script,,0,0,0,,Uchiha Madara lost the battle, \Nbut the battle never truly ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.52,0:05:48.43,Naruto - Script,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1680)}However, the real battle has only just begun.
